From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Branson <andrew.branson@jolla.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Apr 2026 14:12:25 +0200
Subject: Adapt EmbedLite WebRender offscreen compositing

Track safe-area-inset environment variable usage while resolving style and
notify chrome so EmbedLite callers can distinguish pages that intentionally
draw into the cutout area.

Restore a dedicated EGLImage-backed offscreen target for EmbedLite while
leaving ordinary offscreen contexts on the standard framebuffer path.
